          <p>Troy Krueger founded Professional Project Partners in 2003 because he had a passion for helping people pursue their career aspirations.</p>
          <p>As the Founder and President, he has shaped the mission of P3+Uplift to be the industry leader that it is today, guiding its methodical growth, overseeing the addition of successful new divisions, and ensuring the recruiting blueprint is always evolving in support of quality at every turn.</p>
          <p>Always emphasizing P3+Uplift’s team approach, Troy is inspired by the peers he works alongside every day, pooling unique perspectives and ideas to create a cohesive mission across the company.</p>
          <p>Troy’s leadership reinforces a people-first, value-based approach to all areas of P3+Uplift, believing that the right option isn’t always popular or the most profitable. He’s guided by the principle that the true test of a person’s character is what they do when nobody is watching.</p>
