          <p>Kelley McManus is a seasoned leader with over 30 years of experience in technology, delivery, product development and change.</p>
          <p>As the Managing Director at P3+Uplift, Kelley has been instrumental in driving operational excellence, fostering a culture of collaboration, and delivering impactful solutions for clients since January 2020.</p>
          <p>Kelley is the founder of Uplift Delivery, a division of P3+Uplift, a technology and software development company known for delivering high-quality code through Smart Delivery processes and a focus on UX/Design Thinking. Over the years, Kelley has had the privilege of collaborating with this talented team across several organizations, culminating in the exceptional expertise and creativity that define Uplift Delivery today.</p>
          <p>Passionate about mentoring and leadership development, Kelley thrives on empowering teams to achieve their full potential. Kelley’s deep expertise in team building and culture has also informed a long-term transition plan to focus on executive consulting, while continuing to foster growth for the P3+Uplift team.</p>
